{"4468030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OFFBEAT", "steam_appid": 4468030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4778740, 4915040, 4935090], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/f3633c17a65874f08f51b3bfccaf4b82.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 198X, and you're a jobbing composer. You start out with nothing but a toy keyboard shaped like a tiger, and a brand new sequence-o-matic 4-track that your uncle bought from a shady geezer in the pub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Word quickly spreads about the new producer on the block, and soon the commissions are rolling in. Things start humble, recording tracks for weddings, workout videos and corporate presentations, but before long you're getting asked to score fantasy movies, museum openings, and all kinds of crazy stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you'll have to upgrade your kit along the way. Turns out, the local second-hand magazine is a treasure trove of objects that make interesting sounds, from singing garden gnomes and shredders-that-shred-sound-as-well-as-paper, to high-end synthesisers and musical effects. By the end, you'll have figured out a sound that's all your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/a908bb1c2d1c5d8f6214a483a80563ca.poster.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/a908bb1c2d1c5d8f6214a483a80563ca.webm?t=1787229768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/a908bb1c2d1c5d8f6214a483a80563ca.mp4?t=1787229768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/465864a92872250fe0526f08a73eed85.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>OFFBEAT</strong> isn't just a game. All the musical instruments are fully simulated, and the music you're recording is real. The game is secretly a complete audio production tool. Every piece of music you create in the game gets exported and saved locally on your computer as a WAV file, which you can use for whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music production can be costly and complex to get into, especially for beginners. We created <strong>OFFBEAT</strong> to lower barrier to entry and to offer a playful, low-pressure way to learn the basics of audio producion. The goal is just to be expressive and experimental, but by the end you'll have learned a little about synthesizers, sound design, composition and recording. Our hope is that when the game's finished, you'll have the confidence and expertise to carry on composing and recording music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/362baa047c165f1c82cfc0e0c0c8a417.poster.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/362baa047c165f1c82cfc0e0c0c8a417.webm?t=1787229768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/362baa047c165f1c82cfc0e0c0c8a417.mp4?t=1787229768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/4e8e552d2456422f363ede5078882f47.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game meets</strong> a real <strong>audio production tool</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accept jobs, compose music, earn money. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Browse the Riches &amp; Rags Catalogue</strong> to buy new synthesizers, then get <strong>Electric Lacey</strong> <strong>to upgrade</strong> and mod 'em.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make music</strong> in a low-pressure and beginner-friendly setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet</strong> a whole host of weird characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Export your tracks</strong> as a WAV files onto your computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share your tracks</strong> with the world, or just friends – <i>up to you</i>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play through chapters </strong>themed after different styles of electronic music.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/f3633c17a65874f08f51b3bfccaf4b82.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 198X, and you're a jobbing composer. You start out with nothing but a toy keyboard shaped like a tiger, and a brand new sequence-o-matic 4-track that your uncle bought from a shady geezer in the pub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Word quickly spreads about the new producer on the block, and soon the commissions are rolling in. Things start humble, recording tracks for weddings, workout videos and corporate presentations, but before long you're getting asked to score fantasy movies, museum openings, and all kinds of crazy stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you'll have to upgrade your kit along the way. Turns out, the local second-hand magazine is a treasure trove of objects that make interesting sounds, from singing garden gnomes and shredders-that-shred-sound-as-well-as-paper, to high-end synthesisers and musical effects. By the end, you'll have figured out a sound that's all your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/a908bb1c2d1c5d8f6214a483a80563ca.poster.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/a908bb1c2d1c5d8f6214a483a80563ca.webm?t=1787229768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/a908bb1c2d1c5d8f6214a483a80563ca.mp4?t=1787229768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/465864a92872250fe0526f08a73eed85.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>OFFBEAT</strong> isn't just a game. All the musical instruments are fully simulated, and the music you're recording is real. The game is secretly a complete audio production tool. Every piece of music you create in the game gets exported and saved locally on your computer as a WAV file, which you can use for whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music production can be costly and complex to get into, especially for beginners. We created <strong>OFFBEAT</strong> to lower barrier to entry and to offer a playful, low-pressure way to learn the basics of audio producion. The goal is just to be expressive and experimental, but by the end you'll have learned a little about synthesizers, sound design, composition and recording. Our hope is that when the game's finished, you'll have the confidence and expertise to carry on composing and recording music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/362baa047c165f1c82cfc0e0c0c8a417.poster.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/362baa047c165f1c82cfc0e0c0c8a417.webm?t=1787229768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/362baa047c165f1c82cfc0e0c0c8a417.mp4?t=1787229768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/extras/4e8e552d2456422f363ede5078882f47.avif?t=1787229768\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game meets</strong> a real <strong>audio production tool</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accept jobs, compose music, earn money. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Browse the Riches &amp; Rags Catalogue</strong> to buy new synthesizers, then get <strong>Electric Lacey</strong> <strong>to upgrade</strong> and mod 'em.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make music</strong> in a low-pressure and beginner-friendly setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet</strong> a whole host of weird characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Export your tracks</strong> as a WAV files onto your computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share your tracks</strong> with the world, or just friends – <i>up to you</i>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play through chapters </strong>themed after different styles of electronic music.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "OFFBEAT is a music-tycoon game where you build the recording studio of your dreams. Collect and upgrade increasingly strange musical objects, complete jobs for cash, and record real, actual music.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/4e5b3aea6bc0e4d8c764a6dfd00e231f1f8ee858/header.jpg?t=1787229768", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/bd1a807fa48a370ad45a034b291a450f896a60aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787229768", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468030/bd1a807fa48a370ad45a034b291a450f896a60aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787229768", "website": "https://www.whetstone.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 2.2 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Required<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Headphones and/or external speakers recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "OFFBEAT © 2026. Developed by Whetstone Games. Published by Pantaloon Interactive Ltd.", "developers": ["Whetstone Games"], "publishers": ["Pantaloon"], "demos": [{"appid": 4778740, "description": ""}, {"appid": 4778740, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1199, "final": 1019, "discount_percent": 15, "initial_formatted": "$11.99", "final_formatted": "$10.19"}, "packages": [1559526], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy OFFBEAT", "description": "", "selection_text": "Se